WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.134 --> 00:00:16.955
Coby: Hi, Uncle Mike!

2
00:00:16.956 --> 00:00:19.942
Uncle Mike: Thanks for inviting me to Career Day.

3
00:00:19.943 --> 00:00:22.082
Coby: Room Two is this way.

4
00:00:22.083 --> 00:00:26.742
Coby: Everyone is excited about meeting a real firefighter.

5
00:00:26.743 --> 00:00:29.183
Uncle Mike: Some kids met me last year.

6
00:00:29.184 --> 00:00:30.936
I hope they're not bored.

7
00:00:30.937 --> 00:00:36.182
Coby: No way!

8
00:00:36.183 --> 00:00:40.583
Miss Gray: Thank you, Mrs. Gomez.

9
00:00:40.584 --> 00:00:44.231
We learned a lot about taking X-rays.

10
00:00:44.232 --> 00:00:47.618
Jim: Maybe I'll do that when I grow up.

11
00:00:47.619 --> 00:00:51.530
Miss Gray: Our next visitor is Coby's uncle Mike.

12
00:00:51.531 --> 00:00:53.946
Miss Gray: He is going to tell us all about—

13
00:00:53.947 --> 00:00:58.188
Class: Firefighting!

14
00:00:58.189 --> 00:01:03.945
Kara: I remember you from last year!

15
00:01:03.946 --> 00:01:06.555
Uncle Mike: I'm a firefighter.

16
00:01:06.556 --> 00:01:10.310
So I put out fires and rescue people.

17
00:01:10.311 --> 00:01:16.774
Uncle Mike: Are there any questions?

18
00:01:16.775 --> 00:01:20.605
Juan: Um . . . Why did you become a firefighter?

19
00:01:20.606 --> 00:01:24.971
Uncle Mike: Because it's exciting, and I like helping people.

20
00:01:24.972 --> 00:01:28.248
Uncle Mike: My fire truck is parked outside.

21
00:01:28.249 --> 00:01:30.979
We can go see it soon.

22
00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:37.749
Miss Gray: Any more questions, boys and girls? Jim?

23
00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:40.937
Jim: Did you ever save anyone's life?

24
00:01:40.938 --> 00:01:46.025
Uncle Mike: Yes. Last week I rescued three people from a burning house.

25
00:01:46.026 --> 00:01:48.933
Coby: That is so cool!

26
00:01:48.934 --> 00:01:53.605
Jim: Hmm . . . I could be a firefighter when I grow up.

27
00:01:53.606 --> 00:01:56.472
Greg: Hey, here comes my grandpa!

28
00:01:56.473 --> 00:02:00.803
His name is Mr. Brown.

29
00:02:00.804 --> 00:02:03.203
Mark: Is he carrying a cooler?

30
00:02:03.204 --> 00:02:06.312
Ella: Maybe he brought us something.

31
00:02:06.313 --> 00:02:09.070
Miss Gray: Coby's uncle is talking.

32
00:02:09.071 --> 00:02:12.699
Miss Gray: Room Two, would anyone like to ask one more question?

33
00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.735
Kara: Me! I have a question.

34
00:02:15.736 --> 00:02:22.021
What's in Mr. Brown's cooler?
